Title: Every Rounded Conversion, Decimals Fixed.
Note: LAW-SUFFICIENCY-1, E1. A research fixture, off the gate: each rounded conversion the grammar has, once.
§1 Let a be 2.5 rounded to an integer.
§2 Let b be 3.5 as a float rounded to an integer.
§3 Let c be 7 rounded to a fixed.
§4 Let d be (1 as a float divided by 3 as a float) rounded to a fixed.
§5 Let e be 9007199254740993 rounded to a float.
§6 Let f be 3000000.1 rounded to a float.
§7 Say a.
§8 Say b.
§9 Say c.
§10 Say d.
§11 Say e.
§12 Say f.
